<div id="faqAboveFooter" style="background: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-top: 1px solid rgb(34, 34, 34); padding: 2rem 1rem 1rem; text-align: center; width: 100%;"><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem">Ask Qivbuild â€” Frequently Asked Questions</div><p style="color:#c7c7c7;font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.4rem auto 1rem;max-width:36rem">Tap a question to see the answer You can also ask your own question below</p><div style="max-width:36rem;margin:0 auto;text-align:left"><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">How long does a drawing plan take?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Architectural drawings usually take 7 to 15 days depending on plot size and number of floors The layout plan is prepared first followed by the structural electrical and plumbing drawings</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">What information is needed to start building planning?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Plot size and location the plot map or documents the number of floors and rooms required your budget and any special requirements A site visit is then arranged to measure the plot and check levels access and orientation</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">What is included in gray structure?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Excavation foundation columns beams slabs staircase brick masonry and plaster with electrical conduits and plumbing sleeves placed during construction Finishing work such as flooring tiles paint and fixtures is not included</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">How is the cost of interior design calculated?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Cost depends on room sizes materials and the design specification Send your plot size and room list and Qivbuild will give an estimate before the final plan is prepared</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">What does town planning include?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">A master plan of the layout: road network plot divisions parks and open space commercial areas and water supply sewerage and storm water drainage It is prepared for authority approval and phased development</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">How long does renovation take?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">A small renovation takes about 2 to 4 weeks and a full house about 2 to 4 months depending on the scope A condition survey is done first followed by the renovation plan and schedule</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">Where does Qivbuild work?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Qivbuild works from DHA Phase 8 Lahore across Lahore and nearby cities from drawing plan to construction</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">Does Qivbuild prepare approval drawings?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Yes We prepare approval and submission drawings for LDA and TMA including the drawings required for NOC</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">What is the difference between residential and commercial buildings?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Residential buildings are houses and villas planned around room layout privacy and natural light Commercial buildings such as plazas offices and shops are planned for business use with frontage parking fire exits and flexible floor layouts</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">What does banquet hall planning include?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Hall size and seating capacity stage position guest and service entrances kitchen access parking exits ventilation and lighting</p></details><details style="border:1px solid #222;border-radius:10px;margin:0.4rem 0;padding:0.6rem 0.9rem"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:600">What does market planning include?</summary><p style="color:#c7c7c7;margin:0.5rem 0 0">Shop sizes and frontage walkway widths loading access parking drainage fire exits and the electrical load of each shop</p></details></div><div style="max-width:36rem;margin:1rem auto 0;text-align:left"><h3 style="margin:0 0 0.4rem;font-size:1rem">Ask a Question</h3><input id="faqName2" placeholder="Your name" style="width:100%;margin:0.3rem 0;padding:0.6rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #333;background:#111;color:#fff"><textarea id="faqQ2" placeholder="Write your question" style="width:100%;margin:0.3rem 0;padding:0.6rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #333;background:#111;color:#fff"></textarea><button class="pill f" id="faqAskBtn2" type="button">Ask Qivbuild</button><div id="faqAskMsg2" style="color:#4caf50;margin-top:0.5rem;display:none">Thank you! We have received your question and will reply soon</div><div id="faqAskedList2"></div></div></div><footer style="background:#000;color:#fff;border-top:1px solid #222;padding:2rem 1rem 5.5rem;text-align:center;width:100%">
